14,"sd":null},{"k":"20:115","t":"And We had already taken a promise from Adam before, but he forgot; and We found not in him determination.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":115,"sd":null},{"k":"20:116","t":"And [mention] when We said to the angels, \"Prostrate to Adam,\" and they prostrated, except Iblees; he refused.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":116,"sd":null},{"k":"20:117","t":"So We said, \"O Adam, indeed this is an enemy to you and to your wife. Then let him not remove you from Paradise so you would suffer.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":117,"sd":null},{"k":"20:118","t":"Indeed, it is [promised] for you not to be hungry therein or be unclothed.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":118,"sd":null},{"k":"20:119","t":"And indeed, you will not be thirsty therein or be hot from the sun.\"","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":119,"sd":null},{"k":"20:120","t":"Then Satan whispered to him; he said, \"O Adam, shall I direct you to the tree of eternity and possession that will not deteriorate?\"","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":120,"sd":null},{"k":"20:121","t":"And they [i.e., Adam and his wife] ate of it, and their private parts became apparent to them, and they began to fasten over themselves from the leaves of Paradise. And Adam disobeyed his Lord and erred.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":121,"sd":null},{"k":"20:122","t":"Then his Lord chose him and turned to him in forgiveness and guided [him].","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":122,"sd":null},{"k":"20:123","t":"[Allāh] said, \"Descend from it [i.e., Paradise] - all, [your descendants] being enemies to one another. And if there should come to you guidance from Me - then whoever follows My guidance will neither go astray [in the world] nor suffer [in the Hereafter].","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":123,"sd":null},{"k":"20:124","t":"And whoever turns away from My remembrance - indeed, he will have a depressed [i.e., difficult] life, and We will gather [i.e., raise] him on the Day of Resurrection blind.\"","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":124,"sd":null},{"k":"20:125","t":"He will say, \"My Lord, why have you raised me blind while I was [once] seeing?\"","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":125,"sd":null}],"juz":16,"hizb":32,"surahs":[20],"sajdah":false}